      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Logistics]\nWeapon rewards require 2,000 KVM points for each.\nThere are 3 types of Armor rewards and they require 840/630/580 KVM points fo each.\nAccessory rewards require 1,200 KVM points for each.",
